== About me
~~~
{}{img_left}{pic/xmu.png}{alt text}{120}{120}{https://www.xmu.edu.cn/}

I am currently an assistant professor at the [https://iai.xmu.edu.cn/ Institute of Artificial Intelligence], [https://www.xmu.edu.cn/ Xiamen University]. I am also affiliated with Media Analytics & Computing Laboratory (MAC Lab). Before that, I received my M.S. and Ph.D. degrees from [https://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-sen University] in 2021 and 2025, respectively, where I was advised by [https://chenliang.tech/ Prof. Liang Chen], [https://sse.sysu.edu.cn/teacher/159 Prof. Wuhui Chen], and [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zWnsNrkAAAAJ&hl=en Prof. Zibin Zheng].
~~~

My research interests include: 
- Graph Neural Networks
- Recommender Systems
- Large Language Models
- AI4Science

I am always recruiting undergraduate/master students. Please contact me with your CV attached if you are interested in the above topics.


== Recent news

- July 16, 2026: Our team has won 2nd place in the Academic Track and 3rd place in the Industry Track of the Tencent Advertising Algorithm Competition (TAAC 2026).
- May 17, 2026: Two papers have been accepted by KDD 2026, see you in Jeju!
- May, 2026: I was invited to serve as a reviewer for CIKM 2026, ICML-GLM Workshop, ACM MM 2026, NeurIPS 2026.
- April 17, 2026: I was invited to serve as a reviewer for TKDE.
- April 15, 2026: I was selected for the Tencent WeChat Rhino-Bird Special Research Programme (2026 腾讯微信犀牛鸟专项研究计划).
- Feb 13, 2026: I was invited to serve as an Area Chair for KDD 2026 Research Track (Cycle 2).
- November 27, 2025: I joined the Institute of Artificial Intelligence, Xiamen University as an Assistant Professor.
- November 26, 2025: I won second place of Tencent Advertising Algorithm Competition (TAAC 2025).
- November 24, 2025: One paper has been accepted by TKDE.
- October 29, 2025: I was honored with the ACM China (Zhuhai Chapter) Doctoral Dissertation Award in recognition of my outstanding doctoral research in computer science.


